/**
 * /learn/mev-protected-swaps: evergreen canonical answer page for MEV
 * protection. States precisely what IS protected and keeps the qualified
 * "not an absolute guarantee" wording next to every strong claim (same
 * sentence as the homepage FAQ; do not strengthen it here).
